Module fells "The fells" {
  Description "A test fixture region for composing kits: two settlements on a road, a barrow-mound on the road, and gorse country off it where a hold can stand.".
  Place fells "The fells" is region.
  Place dale "Dale" is settlement within fells at 0, 0.
  Place lowroad "the low road" is wilderness within fells at 1, 0.
  Place gorse "the gorse" is wilderness within fells at 1, 1.
  Place fordton "Fordton" is settlement within fells at 2, 0.
  Place market "Dale market" is room within dale at 0, 0.
  Place barrows "the barrow-mound" is room within lowroad at 0, 0.
  Place alders "the alder bend" is room within lowroad at 1, 0.
  Place stones "the standing stones" is room within gorse at 0, 0.
  Place knot_foot "the foot of the knoll" is room within gorse at 1, 0.
  Place hollow "the hollow in the gorse" is room within gorse at 0, 1.
  Place ford_green "Fordton green" is room within fordton at 0, 0.
  Passage dale_road "the Dale road" is road between market and barrows taking 2 hours.
  Passage bend_road "the bend road" is road between barrows and alders taking 1 hour.
  Passage ford_road "the ford road" is road between alders and ford_green taking 1 hour.
  Passage gorse_path "the gorse path" is path between barrows and stones taking 1 hour.
  Passage knoll_path "the knoll path" is path between stones and knot_foot taking 1 hour.
  Passage hollow_path "the hollow path" is path between stones and hollow taking 1 hour.
  Company party "Your company" of 3 at market.
  Initially Set quantity(party, gold) to 20. Initially Set quantity(party, rations) to 3.
  Observe market_scene at market when true "Stalls, and a bell-frame by the chapel door.".
  Observe barrows_scene at barrows when true "A long mound beside the road.".
  Observe alders_scene at alders when true "Alders where the road bends.".
  Observe stones_scene at stones when true "Grey stones standing in the gorse.".
  Observe knot_scene at knot_foot when true "A knoll, ringed with an old bank.".
  Observe ford_scene at ford_green when true "A green by the ford.".
  Observe hollow_scene at hollow when true "A hollow, out of the wind.".
  Goal false.
}
